  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left(\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x}\\right) \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left[\\frac{x\\left(1-\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\right)}{x}\\right] \\times \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left[1-\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\right] \\times \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$\n$=\\left[1-\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\right] \\times \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$\n$=0 \\times \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=0$",
    "image": null
  },
